                                    "verticalAlign": true,
                                    "body": {
                                        "processed": "<p><span class=\"subhead color-accent\">Local &amp; Creative</span></p>\n<h1>MacDonalDesign</h1>\n<p>A fully custom digital ecosystem built with headless Drupal 11, Next.js, and automated CI/CD. The platform combines modern frontend architecture, API-driven content, GitHub integration, and Jenkins deployments into a scalable development workflow.</p>\n<p><a class=\"button transparent\" href=\"https://smmacdonald.github.io\" target=\"_blank\" tabindex=\"0\">View Website</a></p>\n"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
