                                        "__typename": "ParagraphText",
                                        "id": "267",
                                        "verticalAlign": true,
                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "<p><span class=\"subhead color-accent\">PHASE 2 SOLUTION</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"h3\">Headless Next.js Application</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e8c19bdc0643eb173ab66c3da11dbfe15\">Developed a Next.js front end using TypeScript and modern React architecture.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e266104edb158b00364efe853b17d3476\">Implemented a headless Drupal architecture using REST API and GraphQL to retrieve content from Drupal.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e187a5080f20b3566472e25b102119f3d\">Separated the content management layer from the presentation layer, allowing the front end and Drupal platform to evolve independently.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e82214da8d47e23074d2c30b52f22a13e\">Built responsive, reusable UI components with a focus on performance, accessibility, and maintainability.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ea843cd76c8893e5c1cefa8693825e1e8\">Used Node.js, NPM, and modern front-end development tooling to manage the application and build process.</li>\n</ul>\n"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "__typename": "ParagraphSection",
                        "id": "272",
                        "bgColor": "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15)",
                        "bgImage": {
                            "__typename": "MediaBackgroundImage",
                            "id": "13",
                            "mediaImage2": {
                                "url": "__ORIGIN__/sites/default/files/2026-07/noisy-texture-200x200-o39-d95-c-4ac1af-t1.png"
                            }
                        },
                        "bgImagePosition": "center center",
                        "bgImageRepeat": "repeat",
                        "bgImageSize": "auto",
                        "centerContent": false,
                        "fullWidth": false,
                        "margin": null,
                        "padding": "padding-top-bottom-60",
                        "sectionId": null,
                        "content": [
                            {
                                "__typename": "ParagraphColumn",
                                "id": "271",
                                "bgColor": null,
                                "sectionId": null,
                                "columnWidth": [
                                    "col-lg-6"
                                ],
                                "styledBox": false,
                                "element": [
                                    {
                                        "__typename": "ParagraphText",
                                        "id": "270",
                                        "verticalAlign": true,
                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "<p><span class=\"subhead color-accent\">PHASE 3 SOLUTION</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"h3\">CI/CD &amp; Deployment Automation</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e90faeeed3d2241fc7fec39a37c1855dc\">Built automated Jenkins CI/CD pipelines for development and production deployments.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e951d2d2690d0e66c3ab8093955264f19\">Integrated GitHub Actions into the development workflow for automated processes and repository-level tasks.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e51e6400efd5be211a9cf130bc9ab5f30\">Implemented Git-based deployment workflows using separate development and production branches.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e61bd9fd4d860e6a9e86e60c5a6db246d\">Created automated production release tagging and immutable release builds.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e4510a6f5a1f82f17d22cd27fc8175209\">Built deployment scripts that package application code into versioned build artifacts and deploy them to the appropriate environment.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e0739ab08a2fd6144f10f1a5707258c8c\">Implemented automated Drupal deployment tasks including database updates, configuration imports, cache rebuilding, and cleanup of previous releases.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ebff42959867b531cc2fba6cad85402f9\">Designed a release-based deployment architecture with shared files and configuration separated from application code.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e15d56b4af8027a968c3a8fb48886e504\">Added automated deployment verification and failure-stage tracking to improve pipeline visibility and troubleshooting.</li>\n</ul>\n"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
