                                        "__typename": "ParagraphText",
                                        "id": "273",
                                        "verticalAlign": false,
                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "<p class=\"text-align-center\"><span class=\"subhead color-accent\">SUCCESS</span></p>\n<p class=\"text-align-center\"><span class=\"h3\">Impact</span></p>\n<p class=\"text-align-center\">The portfolio became a working demonstration of the development practices it represents. The combination of Drupal 11, Next.js, TypeScript, REST API, GraphQL, GitHub, GitHub Actions, Jenkins, CI/CD, and headless architecture created a scalable platform that separates content management from the front-end experience.</p>\n<p class=\"text-align-center\">The automated deployment infrastructure also transformed the site from a manually maintained project into a repeatable software delivery process. Code changes can move from GitHub through automated builds and testing into versioned development or production releases, with Drupal updates and deployment tasks handled through Jenkins.</p>\n<p class=\"text-align-center\">The result is both a portfolio website and a real-world example of modern web architecture, API integration, DevOps, automation, version control, and full-stack development.</p>\n"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
